# Data files. The full pipeline produces ~22 GB; not appropriate for git.
data/*.jsonl
data/*.json
data/*.csv
data/generations/
data/scored/
data/scored_corrected/
data/audits/
data/batch_requests/
data/batch_state/
data/superheroes/

# Output artifacts. Trained model weights and rendered figures are
# regenerated by the pipeline; the canonical figures live in /figures.
output/*.joblib
output/*.png
output/*.html
output/*.txt
output/*.pdf
output/plotly/

# Results JSONs are tracked individually under results/. Everything else
# in results/ is regenerated by analyze_kink.py.
results/*.html
results/*.png

# API keys and auth. Never commit.
src/data_provenance/load_keys.py
src/data_provenance/models.json
src/data_provenance/wolfow_auth*.json
src/data_provenance/*.token

# Environment and credentials.
.env
.env.*
tmp/
*.secret

# Internal working notes that should not ship publicly.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
memory/

# Raw review documents from prior critiques (synthesised into the paper
# discussion section; the originals contain unredacted reviewer commentary).
ProblemsToFix.txt
ReviewGPT5.2.txt
AUDIT_FINDINGS.md

# Scratch files of any kind.
*.db
*.bin
*.log

# HPC supplementary materials. The supplemental cluster work is not part
